/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":15,"created_at":"2025-12-29T14:53:14Z","updated_at":"2026-01-12T23:11:08Z","closed_at":"2026-01-12T23:11:07Z","assignee":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Occurred in Godot 4.6 Beta 1, Beta 2, Dev 6\n- Tested Dev 4, does not occur in dev 4 which predates the commit that caused the related? [issue](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113588). See comments.\n- I have been unable to cause this to happen on demand in a new project.\n- I need to test dev 5 but likely same outcome there, will do in the morning\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.beta2 - Linux Mint 22.1 (Xia) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090 (nvidia; 570.195.03) - AMD Ryzen 7 9800X3D 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 60.43 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nInitially noticed this during exports - when I exported my project, some scenes would create a Scene-local copy of some external script file, which led to errors at runtime.\n\n```\nSCRIPT ERROR: Parse Error: Class \"PhantomCameraHost\" hides a global script class.\n          at: GDScript::reload (res://StandaloneScripts/Singletons/GameStateController.tscn::GDScript_isyrp:3)\n```\n\nAfter seeing this happen, I searched through the project in an external IDE for any references to isyrp - and there was nothing. Verified that the script references were pointing to the external script, a la\n```\n[node name=\"GlobalPhantomCameraHost\" type=\"Node\" parent=\"UniversalCamera\" unique_id=1056210908]\nprocess_priority = 300\nprocess_physics_priority = 300\nscript = ExtResource(\"2_ysvbm\") \nmetadata/_custom_type_script = \"uid://bd046eokvcnu2\"\n\n[ext_resource type=\"Script\" uid=\"uid://bd046eokvcnu2\" path=\"res://addons/phantom_camera/scripts/phantom_camera_host/phantom_camera_host.gd\" id=\"2_ysvbm\"]\n```\n\nIf I tried to export the project with the scene open, however, it would create the local scripts every time.\n\nThis has happened across multiple scripts, not just addons.\n\nFirst attempted to update from 4.6 B1 to B2, no change.\n\nAfter running Project -> Tools -> Upgrade Project Files, this problem briefly went away. After working on my game and having the editor open for a few hours and running an export, it reoccurred on a completely different scene during a normal save.\n\nI did not catch this happening at all while using 4.5.\n\n\nLooking through previous issues, I did find the following:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113588\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113600/commits/ab0397878c14b508137abb90f4cd071de493dbd3\n\nWhich has similar symptoms. I'm not 100% sure it's the same issue, however, as this happened initially to my GameStateController's PhantomCamera2D, PhantomCameraHost, and a SoundBank node from Resonate. The later occurrence was on my PlayerCharacterRig Node which I'm reasonable confident has no circular dependencies with the PlayerEntity.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nExport MRP on 4.6 Beta 1/2, Dev6\nSometimes occurs on Scene saving.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[ExportIssueMRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24412723/ExportIssueMRP.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114420/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114420/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}